{"id":"jmykhntwxj6r9auprkxaumawu","title":"《女史箴图》的千年流转","originalTitle":null,"summary":"《女史箴图》为东晋画家顾恺之所绘，现存残卷为唐代摹本，历经多次装裱与修补。画卷描绘冯媛当熊、班姬辞辇等场景，线条连绵飘忽，保留六朝画风。该作不仅是研究顾恺之艺术风格的重要资料，也见证了中国绘画从“写形”向“传神”的转变。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2687371&do=blog&id=1561086"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T10:19:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T15:53:15.868Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T15:53:15.868Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ceb48cfd-2e4c-444d-8422-1b815816c992","title":"《女史箴图》唐代摹本揭示顾恺之绘画主张"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ceb48cfd-2e4c-444d-8422-1b815816c992","title":"《女史箴图》唐代摹本揭示顾恺之绘画主张"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fs35i2Ot_5oA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}